  <text>
    <body>
      <p><seg source="#source-30-59">これやこの毛利孟夫</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-59-91">山間の獄にペンを撫し</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-91-135">戦いに病める君が身を養わんと</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-135-152">函数を釣り</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-152-175">積分にゆあみし</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-175-189">ひねもす</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-189-209">土地と資本の</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-209-220">数字と</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-220-231">符号の</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-231-251">時空における</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-251-286">不統一の空隙を逍遥する</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-286-315">君のマルキシズムは</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-315-359">かゝる隙間を埋むるに足れりど</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-359-404">なお詩もて愛すべき膠着剤とせよ</seg></p>
    </body>
